      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "The Moore Theatre is one of Seattle’s most historic and beloved performing arts venues, located in the heart of the city’s downtown theater district. Opened in 1907, it is the oldest operating theater in Seattle and is known for its elegant early-20th-century design and intimate atmosphere. The Moore Theatre hosts a wide range of"
