        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Le Diamant is a contemporary and architecturally striking performance venue located in the heart of…"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Le Diamant is a contemporary and architecturally striking performance venue located in the heart of Québec City. Opened in 2019, the venue was revitalized from a historic building into a modern, multidisciplinary arts space dedicated primarily to circus arts, theatre, music, and innovative stage productions. Its bold design seamlessly blends heritage elements with cutting-edge"
      }
