      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Théâtre Gilles-Vigneault is a modern cultural venue located in Saint-Jérôme, Québec. Known for its excellent…"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Théâtre Gilles-Vigneault is a modern cultural venue located in Saint-Jérôme, Québec. Known for its excellent acoustics and elegant design, the theatre hosts a wide range of concerts, theatrical productions, dance performances, and cultural events. With comfortable seating and state-of-the-art technical facilities, it offers an intimate yet professional setting that creates a strong connection between"
      }
