        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "The Théâtre du Casino du Lac-Leamy is a premier entertainment venue located in Gatineau, Québec,…"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "The Théâtre du Casino du Lac-Leamy is a premier entertainment venue located in Gatineau, Québec, within the renowned Casino du Lac-Leamy complex. Known for its upscale atmosphere and polished production standards, the theatre hosts a wide variety of concerts, comedy shows, musical performances, and special events featuring top local and international artists.\nThe venue offers"
