        "@value": "The New Theatre in Cardiff, United Kingdom, is one of Wales’s most iconic and historic…"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "The New Theatre in Cardiff, United Kingdom, is one of Wales’s most iconic and historic performing arts venues. Located on Park Place in the heart of the city, it has been a cornerstone of Cardiff’s cultural life since its opening in 1906. The theatre is known for its striking Edwardian Baroque architecture and grand"
